        "contenuto_esteso": "The suspected gunman involved in Saturday's shooting at the White House Correspondents' Association (WHCA) dinner is slated to appear in court Monday. Early indications are that likely he was targeting President Trump and other top officials. On Capitol Hill, meanwhile, Senate Republicans say they're losing confidence in Secretary of Defense Pete Hegseth's leadership, with some saying they'd..."
